%% State of a single Chunk through its lifecycle.
%% The split transition is the atomic store on `end`.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Running: worker spawned (Range: current-end)

    Running --> Splitting: coordinator picks this as largest remaining
    Splitting --> Running: victim.end.store(mid) [atomic]<br/>tail chunk [mid,end) spawned

    Running --> Throttled: token bucket empty
    Throttled --> Running: tokens refilled (await)

    Running --> Retry: dropped connection / read timeout
    Retry --> Running: exponential backoff,<br/>reconnect from current
    Retry --> Failed: retries > MAX_RETRIES

    Running --> Paused: paused flag set
    Paused --> Running: resume Notify (re-issue from current)

    Running --> Done: current >= end (or clean EOF if non-resumable)

    Done --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]

    note right of Splitting
        current/end are AtomicU64.
        Victim reloads end each frame
        and stops at the new midpoint.
        Hot path stays lock-free.
    end note
